[
  {
    "title": "Lists & Data Abstraction",
    "tag": "LESSON 17",
    "time": "0–2 min",
    "code": "Chapter 4 · Data & Reusable Algorithms",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">AP Computer Science Principles</p><h1>Lists &amp;<br>Abstraction</h1><p class=\"zh\">列表 · 下标 · 数据抽象</p><p class=\"small\">Build a Study Session Editor · 90 minutes</p>",
    "note": "本章把前面的变量、条件和循环组合为处理多个数据的程序。今天先学列表读写，下一课再遍历。列表值使用分钟，但不是实际收集的学生数据。",
    "kind": "dark"
  },
  {
    "title": "Retrieve values and boundaries",
    "tag": "RETRIEVAL",
    "time": "2–6 min",
    "code": "AAP-1.B · AAP-2.E/F",
    "html": "<ol><li>After a ← 3; b ← a; a ← 8, what is b?</li><li>Evaluate (30 ≥ 30) AND (30 ≤ 180).</li><li>What does a variable name help a reader understand?</li></ol><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>3; true; the meaning of the stored value.</strong></div></details>",
    "note": "先个人回忆第三章赋值与Boolean边界，不把后面的列表集合题当字符串题。复制例只用数值，列表引用别名不在本课范围。"
  },
  {
    "title": "What you will be able to do",
    "tag": "GOALS",
    "time": "6–8 min",
    "code": "AAP-1.C/D · AAP-2.N",
    "html": "<ol><li>Read a list using 1-based positions.</li><li>Update, append, insert and remove values.</li><li>Check current length and valid indices.</li><li>Explain how a list manages program complexity.</li></ol>",
    "note": "数据抽象解释必须联系具体程序：它把相关记录命名为一组，减少分别命名和硬编码，不保证运行更快或存储更少。"
  },
  {
    "title": "One ordered collection, one name",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "time": "8–12 min",
    "code": "AAP-1.C.1–2 · AAP-1.D.6–7",
    "html": "<pre class=\"code\" style=\"font-size:25px;line-height:1.25;padding:18px 24px\">sessions ← [20, 30, 45, 10]</pre><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Four ordered session-minute values are indexed1 through4.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 135\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><text x=\"150.0\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">1</text><rect x=\"25\" y=\"45\" width=\"250\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"150.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">20</text><text x=\"450.0\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">2</text><rect x=\"325\" y=\"45\" width=\"250\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"450.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">30</text><text x=\"750.0\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">3</text><rect x=\"625\" y=\"45\" width=\"250\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"750.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">45</text><text x=\"1050.0\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">4</text><rect x=\"925\" y=\"45\" width=\"250\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1050.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">10</text></svg></figure><p>Each element has a position. Repeated values are allowed.</p>",
    "note": "中括号包围列表字面值，逗号分隔元素。顺序是列表的一部分；索引唯一不代表数值必须不同。每个数表示一次活动分钟数。"
  },
  {
    "title": "An index selects one element",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "time": "12–16 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.N.1",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"The third position is highlighted independently of the numerical values.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 135\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><text x=\"150.0\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">1</text><rect x=\"25\" y=\"45\" width=\"250\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"150.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">20</text><text x=\"450.0\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">2</text><rect x=\"325\" y=\"45\" width=\"250\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"450.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">30</text><text x=\"750.0\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">3</text><rect x=\"625\" y=\"45\" width=\"250\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#f4ecd9\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"750.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">45</text><text x=\"1050.0\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">4</text><rect x=\"925\" y=\"45\" width=\"250\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1050.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">10</text></svg></figure><pre class=\"code\" style=\"font-size:25px;line-height:1.25;padding:18px 24px\">chosen ← sessions[3]</pre><p>What is chosen? Does reading remove a value?</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>45.</strong> Reading leaves the list unchanged.</div></details>",
    "note": "强调AP下标从1开始。第三个值45不是索引45；读出元素不会删除它。高亮位置是寻找目标的支架，仍要学生判断读操作是否改变列表。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Length counts elements",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "time": "16–20 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.N.1",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Four values form one list; length counts slots, not the sum of minutes.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 155\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"15.0\" y=\"12\" width=\"560.0\" height=\"121\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"295.0\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Collection</text><text x=\"295.0\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">[20, 30, 45, 10]</text><path d=\"M582.0 72.5H605.0\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M603.0 65.5L617.0 72.5L603.0 79.5Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"625.0\" y=\"12\" width=\"560.0\" height=\"121\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"905.0\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Question</text><text x=\"905.0\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">How many elements?</text></svg></figure><p>Evaluate LENGTH(sessions) and LENGTH([]).</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>4 and 0.</strong> LENGTH counts elements, not their sum.</div></details>",
    "note": "LENGTH是官方列表过程，与第九课明确给定的字符串教学过程区分。空列表没有第一个元素，长度0。无需为这个问题先学遍历。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Update replaces a value in place",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "time": "20–24 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.N.1",
    "html": "<pre class=\"code\" style=\"font-size:25px;line-height:1.25;padding:18px 24px\">sessions[2] ← 35</pre><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"An update keeps all four positions; only the value at position2 is replaced.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 135\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><text x=\"150.0\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">1</text><rect x=\"25\" y=\"45\" width=\"250\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"150.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">20</text><text x=\"450.0\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">2</text><rect x=\"325\" y=\"45\" width=\"250\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#f4ecd9\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"450.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">new</text><text x=\"750.0\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">3</text><rect x=\"625\" y=\"45\" width=\"250\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"750.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">45</text><text x=\"1050.0\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">4</text><rect x=\"925\" y=\"45\" width=\"250\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1050.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">10</text></svg></figure><p>Predict the full list and its length.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>[20, 35, 45, 10]; length 4.</strong> No element shifts.</div></details>",
    "note": "本页从原始[20,30,45,10]独立开始。只改第2格，不额外增加35，也不改变长度。图中new保留求值任务。"
  },
  {
    "title": "APPEND adds at the end",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "time": "24–28 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.N.1",
    "html": "<p class=\"small\">Start independently with a ← [8, 12, 5].</p><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Append adds one new end slot; earlier elements keep their positions.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 170\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><text x=\"150.0\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">1</text><rect x=\"25\" y=\"45\" width=\"250\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"150.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">8</text><text x=\"450.0\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">2</text><rect x=\"325\" y=\"45\" width=\"250\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"450.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">12</text><text x=\"750.0\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">3</text><rect x=\"625\" y=\"45\" width=\"250\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"750.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">5</text><text x=\"1050.0\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">4</text><rect x=\"925\" y=\"45\" width=\"250\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#f4ecd9\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1050.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">new</text><text x=\"1075\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">APPEND</text></svg></figure><pre class=\"code\" style=\"font-size:25px;line-height:1.25;padding:18px 24px\">APPEND(a, 9)</pre><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>[8, 12, 5, 9]; length 4.</strong> APPEND can also add the first element to an empty list variable.</div></details>",
    "note": "实际代码中APPEND的首参数用列表变量，比如empty←[]后APPEND(empty,9)。口头规则表示往空列表追加也有效，不要求把字面量直接当可变目标。已存在的元素索引不变。"
  },
  {
    "title": "INSERT opens a position",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "time": "28–32 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.N.1",
    "html": "<p class=\"small\">Start independently with a ← [8, 12, 5]. Insert at index 2.</p><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A new slot opens at position2. Existing values12 and5 shift one index to the right.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 205\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><text x=\"150.0\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">1</text><rect x=\"25\" y=\"45\" width=\"250\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"150.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">8</text><text x=\"450.0\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">2</text><rect x=\"325\" y=\"45\" width=\"250\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#f4ecd9\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"450.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">new</text><text x=\"750.0\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">3</text><rect x=\"625\" y=\"45\" width=\"250\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"750.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">12</text><text x=\"1050.0\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">4</text><rect x=\"925\" y=\"45\" width=\"250\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1050.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">5</text><path d=\"M480 145H668\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M666 138L680 145L666 152Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><text x=\"600\" y=\"185\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"400\">Existing values shift right</text></svg></figure><pre class=\"code\" style=\"font-size:25px;line-height:1.25;padding:18px 24px\">INSERT(a, 2, 9)</pre><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>[8, 9, 12, 5]; length 4.</strong></div></details>",
    "note": "INSERT不会替换原第2个值，而是把它及其后的元素右移。只用原列表内有效索引；末尾新增统一用APPEND，避免其他语言允许n+1插入的惯例混入。"
  },
  {
    "title": "REMOVE closes a position",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "time": "32–36 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.N.1",
    "html": "<p class=\"small\">Start independently with a ← [8, 12, 5, 9]. Remove index 2.</p><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"After removing a position, later values shift left; the remaining list has three positions.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 180\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><text x=\"275.0\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">1</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"45\" width=\"250\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"275.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">8</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">2</text><rect x=\"475\" y=\"45\" width=\"250\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">later</text><text x=\"925.0\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">3</text><rect x=\"800\" y=\"45\" width=\"250\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"925.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">later</text><text x=\"600\" y=\"156\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"400\">Later values shift left</text></svg></figure><pre class=\"code\" style=\"font-size:25px;line-height:1.25;padding:18px 24px\">REMOVE(a, 2)</pre><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>[8, 5, 9]; length 3.</strong> The argument 2 is an index, not a value to search for.</div></details>",
    "note": "REMOVE按索引删除，不会遍历寻找数值2。删除后每个后续值索引减一，所以多次操作必须基于当前列表重画下标。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Check the current valid index range",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "time": "36–39 min",
    "code": "AAP-1.D.8",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"For a three-element list, indices1,2,3 are valid;0 and4 are outside.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 140\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"25\" y=\"45\" width=\"200\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"125.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">0 ✕</text><rect x=\"260\" y=\"45\" width=\"200\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"360.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">1 ✓</text><rect x=\"495\" y=\"45\" width=\"200\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"595.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">2 ✓</text><rect x=\"730\" y=\"45\" width=\"200\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"830.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">3 ✓</text><rect x=\"965\" y=\"45\" width=\"200\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1065.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">4 ✕</text></svg></figure><p>For a ← [8, 5, 9], what happens at a[0] or a[4]?</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>An index error terminates the program.</strong> Valid indexed access is 1 through LENGTH(a).</div></details>",
    "note": "错误不是返回0、空字符或循环绕回。当前参考表所有带索引操作遵循1..LENGTH。整数索引是前提；空列表当前没有可访问的元素。课堂错误示例单独运行，不中断完整项目工作。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Why a named collection helps",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "time": "39–42 min",
    "code": "AAP-1.D.1–4/6",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Many separately named session variables are represented by one named collection.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 155\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"15.0\" y=\"12\" width=\"560.0\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"295.0\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Separate names</text><text x=\"295.0\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">s1, s2, s3, s4, ...</text><path d=\"M582.0 75.0H605.0\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M603.0 68.0L617.0 75.0L603.0 82.0Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"625.0\" y=\"12\" width=\"560.0\" height=\"126\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"905.0\" y=\"49\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#225a83\" font-weight=\"700\">Data abstraction</text><text x=\"905.0\" y=\"104\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">sessions: one list</text></svg></figure><p>A changing number of sessions can use one collection and the same list operations.</p><details><summary>Show a specific explanation</summary><div class=\"answer\">Adding sessions does not require inventing another variable name each time. Later, one traversal can process the collection.</div></details>",
    "note": "避免“列表让程序更简单”这样空泛句。联系本例记录数量可变、只需一组同样操作；不宣称列表一定更快或物理存储连续。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Equal values still occupy different positions",
    "tag": "CONCEPT",
    "time": "42–44 min",
    "code": "AAP-1.C.1–3",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Two equal30-minute values are different list elements at positions1 and2.\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 140\" style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><text x=\"275.0\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">1</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"45\" width=\"250\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#f4ecd9\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"275.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">30</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">2</text><rect x=\"475\" y=\"45\" width=\"250\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#f4ecd9\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">30</text><text x=\"925.0\" y=\"33\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" fill=\"#28766f\" font-weight=\"700\">3</text><rect x=\"800\" y=\"45\" width=\"250\" height=\"70\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"925.0\" y=\"91\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"32\" fill=\"#193148\" font-weight=\"700\">10</text></svg></figure><p>For a ← [30, 30, 10], predict REMOVE(a, 1).</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>[30, 10].</strong> One occurrence is removed; the other remains.</div></details>",
    "note": "重复值有不同索引。每个元素可以代表不同活动，所以不能无理由去重；以后FOR EACH会分别处理每个出现。"
